    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《諸葛四郎——大戰魔鬼黨》&nbsp;</span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">電影觀後感想&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">李楠崇</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg9odx1udJb8vw1oCVfgT4QGp1nM9DKAo5MfMie03Aj3nPDuDk4NoI34xpWyVRIRPVnwxN_GFee06gBssy9g2bHTDXhWZzRSCRbXRpN2f-TUseCy1NIbfduSnwyvBncswQ2dHB0677hvKOIqjMfIJnVd7J-kkcyagQo-aHouYvAVYak0RCX3p9Rcm9UBSvp=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjWIXhMGteeIZw_YfyI6Z-VcJ9i-5-D77th33ioqYVWDqQB233SbjuwdwNW3GZr2ocDYiadi_4hynK0BTSq__1QkY9KKCfOpwhYYTxwcIdi5_pm753aXJi1eYj53f1U94ranmCppulItd-C4CFOgXYLrldnwEUMEOGaDoEC_aUmG85vPyXgyZL1lMWujLhX\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgwhR6R_MdMcdr818-wP2aMAvHBjjzLi-jPoQfhsbvPrf7r4wwzl6Liiv1GtMeXSxuL1Xq2uyGaXLB0KFWbXXeg0yNPpaBhiR9cPg9DMUQLgQesa4uGBpmubF_DqT5UUWTiPTHL0JsPvmttrI9Pc-tawMl4InY6QdGzcOK7vk4jBS_Iny3jmE-0lRA6e8D8=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Lán台灣tī 1960到1970年代，m̄-nā布袋戲、武俠影戲tshìng kah掠bē tiâu，若講著bàng-gà、尪仔冊mā是熱hut-hut，尤其是本土ê尪仔冊《諸葛四郎》，大多數ê學生囡仔lóng sio爭beh看。武俠冒險ê劇情，為著正義tsiok綿tsinn，故事節奏tsiânn緊快，tsiânn做hit个時代ê英雄。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">今年6--月聽著何信翰教授講，tsit phō尪仔冊已經拍做動畫電影，m̄-nā有華語、客語，koh有台語配音ê版本，所擺伊邀請tsit个團隊tī 7月初5 tsit工下晡來台中教育大學放電影。聽著tsit个消息tsua̋nn目睭thián大蕊……有影--無？我細漢ê時，綿死綿爛kā同學、兄哥借來看ê尪仔冊，竟然有3D電影thang看koh免錢？趕緊招有志kah我ê學生來欣賞。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit工現場逐家lóng thang提《我的第一本諸葛四郎》tsit本彩色ê冊tńg去做記念，人koh不止仔濟，大人囡仔、阿公阿媽sio爭入場，koh有規家伙仔uì新竹來--ê，in講：「專工盤車beh來看第三遍。」囡仔ná看ná笑，大人ná看ná懷念，每一sian尪仔畫kah tsiânn suí、幼路，動作精準koh活骨，主題曲、配樂有夠好聽。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">每一个角色lóng有鋪排，原來tsit位有智慧ê勇跤——四郎ê名是「諸葛亮」、「楊四郎」ê合稱，真平是「做人tio̍h-ài真，做事ài平實」，女主角阿玉--à公主tsiok在膽，武藝高強，kah in做伙拍歹人，tse是編劇特別強調性別平權、女力ê時代。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Iáu-koh有，台語字幕kah配音tsiok正pān koh tuann-tiah，聽講團隊為著「華陰村」ê「陰」tsit个合喙音講了無真準，koh khai時間重錄，有影hē工夫、tsiok感心。對話內容mā展現本土語言suí-khuì ê所在——有gia̍t-khiat仔話「蠓仔叮牛角——白了工」；傳統囡仔歌「一--ê炒米芳，二--ê炒韭菜，三--ê tshiâng-tshiâng滾，四--ê炒米粉」；koh有俗語「頂港有名聲，下港有出名」等等——真正是本土教育ê好教材。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">煞戲了後iáu有「有獎徵答」，有記念衫、siáu鬼仔殼、規套ê冊等等ê珍寶thang提，我mā有攑手回答問題，規本ê尪仔標提著手，爽歪歪，有食koh有掠，暢kah！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1970年代因為政府推動「國語政策」，對tsia-ê台語bàng-gà、影戲進行審查kah管制，tsiok濟作品tsua̋nn hōo人「查禁」，打壓本土創作ê發展。葉佳龍先生為著beh記念in老爸，也就是創作tsit个偉大英雄ê作者——葉宏甲先生，決意beh hōo「諸葛四郎」koh活--起-來，tī 2017年kah紙風車劇團合作，兩年內搬演beh到40場ê舞台劇。Mā因為真成功，m̄-tsiah後手無惜粗本，hē性命製作tsit齣電影，拄開始是華語版本，tsiah-koh有客語、台語配音。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">根據黃昆輝教授教育基金會tī 2024年3--月做ê調查，有七成ê民眾認為台灣各族群ê母語lóng有消失ê危機，有八成ê民眾肯定看活潑koh心適ê bàng-gà影戲iah是sńg遊戲，是學習母語ê好方法。我tī-leh想：葉--先-生tsiah-nī hē心神創作本土影戲kah濟濟文創作品，m̄-nā ē tī世間留落好名聲，tī tshui-sak母語復振ê tsit條路mā ē有伊ê歷史意義kah定位。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">無仝時代lóng有hit个時代ê英雄，《諸葛四郎》tsit齣電影hōo老輩--ê kā美好ê記持tsiâu揣--tńg-來，hōo少年輩認bat諸葛四郎tsit个講義氣koh堅定ê英雄，學著平凡ê人有一工mā ē-tàng做一件hōo人驕傲ê代誌。凡勢koh ē-tàng kā lán 21世紀逐家ê正義感叫醒，hōo社會ê氣氛變koh-khah好mā無的確。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">終其尾tio̍h-ài靠koh-khah濟本土語言ê戲齣、文學作品呈現，hōo民眾知影母語ê suí，koh肯開喙講阿母ê話。期待諸葛四郎團隊ē-tàng接suà出續集，因為文化傳承tsiânn重要，ài靠你我做伙sak。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator